cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use xdflow in your work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "xdflow: metadata-driven machine-learning pipelines for labeled structured data"
abstract: >-
  xdflow is a Python framework for machine-learning pipelines on labeled, structured data built on
  xarray. Dimensions and coordinates such as trial, channel, time, subject and session travel with the
  data through preprocessing, fitting, cross-validation, tuning and prediction, so splits are requested
  by name and stateful steps are refit inside each training fold.
authors:
